# What must NOT enter the build context.
#
# Without this file the build engine dutifully copies the whole directory, which
# holds two finished artifacts of about 500 MB each (infiny.wsl and
# installer/infiny.wsl), a 213 MB venv and .git. Over a 9p mount that is minutes
# of waiting before the first line of the Dockerfile even runs.
#
# The rule is simple: only what a COPY names ends up in the image.

*.wsl
*.tar
*.tar.gz
venv/
bin/
scripts/
old/
.git/
.github/
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
.claude/
installer/
web-stack/searxng/settings.yml.bak

# Developer documentation — only README.md and NOTICE.md go into the image
CONTEXT.md
GUIDE.md
PHASE1.md
